    <div class="zone cohort"><b>01 · Clinical cohort</b><span>OpenPedCan clinical source and label coverage</span></div>
    <div class="zone disease"><b>02 · Disease context</b><span>Selected tumour label used for source grouping</span></div>
    <div class="zone molecular"><b>03 · Molecular observations</b><span>Aggregated gene-symbol observations and source lineage</span></div>
  </div>
